Build STAMP (Secure Tracking & Anonymous Meeting Protocol) — a cryptographic 
system that replaces paper AA/NA/Recovery attendance cards with unforgeable, 
geohash-locked digital verification.

THE PROBLEM WE'RE SOLVING:
• Courts require proof of meeting attendance for probation/parole
• Paper cards are easily forged, lost, and create administrative burden
• GPS tracking apps violate 4th Amendment rights and user trust
• Counties need audit-ready verification without surveillance liability

THE SOLUTION:
• Check-in + Check-out double-lock verification using Precision-7 geohashes
• Cryptographic "Proof of Presence" without storing raw location data
• Zero-knowledge audit where POs verify stamps without seeing movement history
• Rotating QR codes that cannot be replayed or pre-generated

